{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"strange-urological-cornsnake","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/unit/review_bot cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/review_bot/test_rp04_s5_decision_auth_heldout.py:1-14, 63-65` — Preserve auth-before-work and runtime forwarding. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/review_bot/test_rp04_s5_rotation_heldout.py:1-14` — Preserve immutable binding, restart rotation, fresh snapshots, and fail-open telemetry. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/review_bot/test_rp04_s5_startup.py:1-17` — Preserve startup composition, typed auth rejection, and runtime forwarding. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/review_bot/test_rp04_s5_token_nonleak_heldout.py:1-9` — Preserve bearer-token exclusion and snapshot validation. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/review_bot/test_rp04_s5_decision_auth_heldout.py tests/unit/review_bot/test_rp04_s5_rotation_heldout.py tests/unit/review_bot/test_rp04_s5_startup.py tests/unit/review_bot/test_rp04_s5_token_nonleak_heldout.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"8455-598a-8245-4f4b","parent_id":"ae4d-df34-480d-4c88","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/unit/review_bot"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788572463673038427,"uuid":"73889c07-1b47-4dfd-9246-8e6394616582"}